---
layout: false
permalink: /advertise/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- set totalGroups = 0 %}
{%- for cat in collections.categories %}
  {%- set totalGroups = totalGroups + cat.data.groupCount %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- set formUrl = "https://tally.so/r/dbaRVr" %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include "partials/head.njk" %}
  <title>Advertise on Vancouver Community | {{ site.shortTitle }}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Sponsor a category page, a banner or the weekly newsletter on Vancouver Community. From $25. Every paid spot is labelled Ad.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Advertise on Vancouver Community">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Put your studio, shop or space in front of people looking for groups and classes in Vancouver. Every paid spot is labelled Ad.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.url }}/advertise/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="{{ site.url }}/og-image.png">
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}/advertise/">
</head>
<body class="category-page">
<a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>
{% include "partials/topbar.njk" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <div class="frame page">
    <p class="breadcrumbs">
      <a href="/">Directory</a> &rsaquo;
      <span class="breadcrumb-current">Advertise</span>
    </p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Advertise on Vancouver Community</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">People find this site when they search for things like <em>“run clubs vancouver”</em> or <em>“pottery classes vancouver”</em>. If you run a studio, shop or space where people meet, a sponsorship puts you on the page they land on. It's also how I keep the directory free.</p>

    <div class="columns">
      <div class="col-main">

        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Who visits</h2>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p>Most people come from Google. They search for things like <em>“board game cafe vancouver”</em> or <em>“how to make friends in vancouver”</em>. They live here, and they want something to join.</p>
            <table class="details advertise-stats">
              <tbody>
                <tr><th scope="row">Categories</th><td>{{ collections.categories.length }}</td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row">Groups listed</th><td>{{ totalGroups }}+</td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row">Visits</th><td>About 3,800 in October 2026</td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row">Page views</th><td>About 11,000 in October 2026</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <p class="panel-note">Ask me and I'll send the latest numbers for the page you want.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel advertise-tier">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Category sponsor</h2>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="advertise-price">$39/month <span>or $350/year</span></p>
            <ul class="link-list">
              <li>Your card at the top of one category page, above the listings.</li>
              <li>One sponsor per category.</li>
              <li>I welcome you in the weekly newsletter when you start.</li>
            </ul>
            {%- set sponsorData = { name: "Clayground Studio", where: "Mount Pleasant", description: "Drop-in wheel nights and 6-week beginner courses. First class is on us.", cta: "See class times" } %}
            {%- set sponsorSlot = "advertise-example" %}{% set sponsorDemo = true %}
            {%- set sponsorCaption = "An example. You send a short description and one link, and I check them. The card always says “Community sponsor” and “Ad”." %}
            {% include "partials/sponsor-card.njk" %}
            <a class="advertise-cta" href="{{ formUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="category">Claim a category &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel advertise-tier">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Category banner</h2>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="advertise-price">$25/month <span>or $250/year</span></p>
            <ul class="link-list">
              <li>Your own image between the listings on one category page.</li>
              <li>One banner per category.</li>
            </ul>
            <figure class="advertise-figure">
              <div class="advertise-banner-demo advertise-banner-wide" aria-hidden="true">Your banner</div>
              <figcaption class="panel-note">Category banner at real size: 600 &times; 150 on the page. Send a 1200 &times; 300 PNG or JPG, or ask and I'll make a simple one. It's labelled “Ad”.</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <a class="advertise-cta" href="{{ formUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="category-banner">Book a banner &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel advertise-tier">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Sidebar banner</h2>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="advertise-price">$79/month</p>
            <ul class="link-list">
              <li>Your image in the sidebar of every category page and guide, the blog, the homepage, Start here and About.</li>
              <li>The most-seen spot on the site.</li>
              <li>One advertiser at a time.</li>
            </ul>
            <figure class="advertise-figure">
              <div class="advertise-banner-demo advertise-banner-box" aria-hidden="true">Your banner</div>
              <figcaption class="panel-note">Sidebar banner at real size: 300 &times; 250 on the page. Send a 600 &times; 500 PNG or JPG. It's labelled “Ad”.</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <a class="advertise-cta" href="{{ formUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="sidebar-banner">Book the sidebar &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel advertise-tier">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Newsletter classified</h2>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="advertise-price">$25/issue</p>
            <ul class="link-list">
              <li>A short listing in the weekly <a href="/newsletter/">Vancouver roundup</a>, labelled as paid.</li>
              <li>One per issue. First come, first served.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="advertise-cta" href="{{ formUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="newsletter">Book an issue &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel advertise-tier">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Homepage and guide pages</h2>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="advertise-price">Ask me for a price</p>
            <ul class="link-list">
              <li><strong>Homepage partner:</strong> one business on the homepage.</li>
              <li><strong>Guide pages:</strong> one sponsor on Start here, Free things to do, Neighbourhoods, the blog and About.</li>
              <li><strong>Neighbourhood pages:</strong> good for a business tied to one area, like a Kitsilano studio or an East Van space.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="advertise-cta" href="{{ formUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="other">Ask about pricing &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="col-side">
        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">How to start</h2>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p>Fill in the short form, or email me at <a href="mailto:vancouver@bolle.co?subject=Sponsoring%20the%20directory" data-umami-event="click-advertise-email" data-umami-event-tier="general">vancouver@bolle.co</a>. Tell me what you run and which spot you'd like.</p>
            <p>I'll reply within a couple of days. You get a simple monthly invoice, and you can cancel anytime.</p>
            <a class="advertise-cta" href="{{ formUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="general">Fill in the form &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">House rules</h2>
          <ul class="panel-body link-list">
            <li><strong>A place to meet people.</strong> Classes, drop-ins, leagues, events and spaces. Your business has to pass the “can I find my people here?” test.</li>
            <li><strong>Always labelled.</strong> Every paid spot says “Ad”.</li>
            <li><strong>Listings stay the same.</strong> A sponsorship never adds, changes or removes a regular listing.</li>
            <li><strong>Groups are always free.</strong> Run a club? <a href="/submit/">Submit it here</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>I can say no.</strong> If a sponsorship doesn't work for readers, I'll end it and refund you.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
</main>
{% include "partials/scripts.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
